      "side": 1,
      "message": "Am I right that the PUT on the whole network-topology container also reports deleted for any topology an earlier suite left in config (e.g. topology-netconf)? Then this returns after the PUT\u0027s notification and the DELETE\u0027s is never checked. Waiting until the log holds two data-changed-notification elements would pin it to the second request.",
